    "result_text": "The build passes with all tests green. The refactor is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the standalone `checkDigit`.\n\n**New / renamed logic**\n- **`MemberId`** (replaces `CustomerCode`): the single definition of the id. `format(region, registrationDate, telephone, lastName)` builds `<REGION>` + 2-digit `<FY>` (via `FiscalYear.shortYear`) + `<HASH8>` (the same `Sha256.hex(telephone+lastName, 8)` used by the region-and-hash identity) + `<CHK>` (a `Luhn` check digit over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`). It also parses `region(id)` and `fiscalYear(id)` back out, and keeps the `-<n>` collision dedup.\n- **`AssignMemberId`** (replaces `AssignOwnerCustomerCode`): derives region, formats the id, and dedups against existing `memberId`s. Collision handling now applies to the memberId.\n\n**Repointed consumers**\n- `OwnerMapper`: dropped `membershipNumber`/`checkDigit`; `fiscalYear` now reads the FY segment out of `memberId`, and `locality` (which feeds `ownerSegment`) reads the region out of `memberId`.\n- `OwnerIdentity.primary` \u2192 `owner.getMemberId()`, so `OwnerCreatedEvent` (component renamed to `memberId`) and `AuditOwnerCreated`'s human-readable line both reference the memberId; the audit step no longer needs the mapper.\n- `FiscalYear` lost the now-unused `label` method; stale javadoc references in `Sha256`, `SameCity`, `Luhn` updated.\n\n**Persistence / contract**\n- `Owner`: `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`; schema column renamed to `member_id` (widened to `VARCHAR(32)`/`TEXT`) across h2/hsqldb/mysql/postgres.\n- `openapi.yml`: `customerCode`, `checkDigit`, `membershipNumber` schemas removed; `memberId` added; `fiscalYear`/`locality` descriptions now say \"read back from \u2026 its memberId\".\n- Pipeline YAML step renamed `assignCustomerCode` \u2192 `assignMemberId`.\n\nThe acceptance test (`memberId` starts with `NSW`, contains the SHA-256 HASH8, and the old fields are gone) passes \u2014 verified in the audit line `memberId=NSW2616E6609E3` (NSW \u00b7 26 \u00b7 16E6609E \u00b7 3).",
